@OrderingService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5003
@AccessToken = replace-with-access-token

### Create an order (the UserId is read from the JWT, not the JSON body)
POST {{OrderingService_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Idempotency-Key: order-request-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": 1,
  "quantity": 2
}

### List the current user's orders
GET {{OrderingService_HostAddress}}/api/orders?page=1&pageSize=20&status=Pending
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Get an order owned by the current user
GET {{OrderingService_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Cancel an order (repeating this call is safe)
POST {{OrderingService_HostAddress}}/api/orders/1/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{AccessToken}}
